design:
**Reference: kozakdenys/qr-code-styling**

1. **Creating SVG Gradients** - `src/core/QRSVG.ts` in `_createColor()` method:
   ```typescript
   private _createColor(options: Gradient, color: string, ...): void {
     const rect = document.createElementNS('...', 'rect');

     if (options) {  // Gradient options provided
       let gradient;

       if (options.type === 'radial') {
         gradient = document.createElementNS('...', 'radialGradient');
         gradient.setAttribute('cx', '50%');
         gradient.setAttribute('cy', '50%');
         gradient.setAttribute('r', '50%');
       } else {  // linear
         gradient = document.createElementNS('...', 'linearGradient');
         // Calculate x1, y1, x2, y2 based on rotation
       }

       // Add color stops
       options.colorStops.forEach(({ offset, color }) => {
         const stop = document.createElementNS('...', 'stop');
         stop.setAttribute('offset', String(offset * 100) + '%');
         stop.setAttribute('stop-color', color);
         gradient.appendChild(stop);
       });
     }
   }
   ```

2. **Canvas Gradients**:
   ```typescript
   const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(x1, y1, x2, y2);
   // or
   const gradient = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx, cy, r1, cx, cy, r2);

   gradient.addColorStop(0, 'color1');
   gradient.addColorStop(1, 'color2');
   ctx.fillStyle = gradient;
   ```

See: https://github.com/kozakdenys/qr-code-styling/blob/master/src/core/QRSVG.ts

